      "mergeID": "65e5e52c2c95644f2aa11cf6",
      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Open VRChat, 2. load into home world (or immediately get sent to the something went wrong world) 3. Avi's wont load nor can I join any worlds or invites, 4. get sent to something went wrong world randomly from my home world, 5. After clearing the content cache I no longer can join my home world (it wont even start downloading the world)",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Can't load into worlds",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
